 "text": "Grant County Geospatial Hub\n-->\n-->\nSkip Navigation\nAdd to Favorites\nTranslate\nAdd to Favorites\nTranslate\nClose\nSign In\nExplore\nData\nDocuments\nApps & Maps\nRecent Downloads\nNew\nSign In\nGrant County Geospatial Hub\nHome\nProperty\nLand\nElections\nOpen Data\nApplications\nPortal\nMore\nHome\nProperty\nLand\nElections\nOpen Data\nApplications\nPortal\nGrant County Geospatial Hub\nConnecting people, locations, and data using interactive maps\nHow to Use the Hub\nThe Hub brings authoritative and data-driven initiatives to life by combining data, visualization, analytics, and collaboration technology to enable governments and citizens to work together on real-world initiatives that tackle everyday challenges and the most pressing issues in their communities.\nArcGIS Hub transforms how we engage and collaborate with our community using data-driven tools for innovation.\nFeatured Content\nA collection of maps and apps that share the exciting activities happening in our community and answer some of the most frequent asked questions.\nUncovering History\nDiscovery and preservation of 100 years of design and craftsmanship in Grant County, Minnesota.\nLearn about how historical paintings and designs were found during the courthouse rehabilitation project and the journey towards uncovering the building's history. Dive into this icon of the county's heritage and window into the past.\n|\n© 2022 Grant County, MN. , Pro-West and Associates, Inc. |\nPhone: 218-685-8232\nEmail: assessor@co.grant.mn.us\n10 2nd St NE\nElbow Lake, MN 56531\nBuilt with\nArcGIS Hub\nExplore Feeds\nTranslate",
